# UI Component License

All UI components in this directory are custom-built for the GitStory project
and are licensed under the MIT License (see the root LICENSE file).

## Third-Party Dependencies Used by UI Components

### Google Material Symbols
- **License:** Apache License 2.0
- **Source:** https://fonts.google.com/icons
- **Usage:** Icon font loaded via Google Fonts CDN
- MaterialIcon.tsx wraps Google Material Symbols Outlined as React components

### Framer Motion
- **License:** MIT License
- **Source:** https://github.com/framer/motion
- **Usage:** Animation library used for transitions and micro-interactions

### React / React DOM
- **License:** MIT License
- **Source:** https://github.com/facebook/react

### Next.js
- **License:** MIT License
- **Source:** https://github.com/vercel/next.js
